{"id":"msg_m_main_07af_05_03","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_counters_s","label":"Counters · Chat"},"label":"13. There is an old facility beyond the ruins.","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_main_07af_05_02","next":"msg_m_nikke_harran_01","speakers":{"exia":"Exia","anis":"Anis","neon":"Neon"},"icons":{"exia":"si_c210_00_s","anis":"si_c012_00_s","neon":"si_c011_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_main_07af_05_03_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_07af_05_03_1","text":"There is an old facility beyond the ruins.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_07af_05_03_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_07af_05_03_2","text":"It was originally a munitions facility,","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_07af_05_03_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_07af_05_03_3","text":"so the building is well-equipped.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_07af_05_03_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_07af_05_03_4","text":"That includes scanning devices.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_07af_05_03_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_07af_05_03_5","text":"Will scanning take long?","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_07af_05_03_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_07af_05_03_6","text":"Even if we manage to get everything up and running, can this bullet even be scanned?","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_07af_05_03_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_07af_05_03_7","text":"I think so.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_07af_05_03_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_07af_05_03_8","text":"That bullet shell","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_07af_05_03_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_07af_05_03_9","text":"is slightly older than the munitions facility.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_07af_05_03_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_07af_05_03_10","text":"There's a database there on materials used for bullets.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_07af_05_03_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_07af_05_03_11","text":"Probably.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_07af_05_03_12","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_07af_05_03_12","text":"And the location?","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_07af_05_03_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_07af_05_03_13","text":"I know where it is.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_07af_05_03_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_07af_05_03_14","text":"I can tell you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_07af_05_03_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_07af_05_03_15","text":"Do you want to go with us?","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_07af_05_03_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_07af_05_03_16","text":"Hardly!","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_07af_05_03_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_07af_05_03_17","text":"Novel and I have other business to attend to.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_07af_05_03_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_07af_05_03_18","text":"But we can provide you with support.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_07af_05_03_19","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_07af_05_03_19","text":"Do you know anything about the Heretics?","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_07af_05_03_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_07af_05_03_20","text":"A little bit.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_07af_05_03_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_07af_05_03_21","text":"The rumors aren't far off.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_07af_05_03_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_07af_05_03_22","text":"People say they are Nikkes who surrendered to the Raptures out of fear.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_07af_05_03_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_07af_05_03_23","text":"That the Raptures took them and reconfigured them.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_07af_05_03_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_07af_05_03_24","text":"That they're a new type of Nikke, or an enhanced version.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_07af_05_03_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_07af_05_03_25","text":"But few people have actually met them face-to-face.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_07af_05_03_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_07af_05_03_26","text":"It's better to start from 0.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_07af_05_03_27","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_07af_05_03_27","text":"Has there ever been a case where a Nikke was resurrected?","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_07af_05_03_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_07af_05_03_28","text":"No.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_07af_05_03_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_07af_05_03_29","text":"Never.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_07af_05_03_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_07af_05_03_30","text":"Novel is asking around.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_07af_05_03_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_07af_05_03_31","text":"But don't get your hopes up.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_07af_05_03_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_07af_05_03_32","text":"If you need me to, I can poke around in the Central Government's database.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_07af_05_03_33","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_07af_05_03_33","text":"Only if you're comfortable with it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_07af_05_03_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_07af_05_03_34","text":"Okay.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_07af_05_03_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_07af_05_03_35","text":"We'll see.","jump":null}],"chat":true}